            "code": "```java\npublic void passivateObject(final PooledObject<PoolableConnection> p) throws SQLException  {\n    validateLifetime(p);\n    final PoolableConnection conn = p.getObject();\n    Boolean connAutoCommit = null;\n    if (rollbackOnReturn)\n    {\n        connAutoCommit = conn.getAutoCommit();\n        if (!connAutoCommit && !conn.isReadOnly())\n        {\n            conn.rollback();\n        }\n    }\n    conn.clearWarnings();\n    // DBCP-97 / DBCP-399 / DBCP-351 Idle connections in the pool should // have autoCommit enabled if (autoCommitOnReturn)\n    {\n        if (connAutoCommit == null)\n        {\n            connAutoCommit = conn.getAutoCommit();\n        }\n        if (!connAutoCommit)\n        {\n            conn.setAutoCommit(true);\n        }\n    }\n    conn.passivate();\n}\n```"
